{
  "sn43.12:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 43.12 ",
  "sn43.12:0.2": "2. Dutiyavagga ",
  "sn43.12:0.3": "Asaṅkhatasutta ",
  "sn43.12:1.1": "“Asaṅkhatañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi asaṅkhatagāmiñca maggaṁ. ",
  "sn43.12:1.2": "Taṁ suṇātha. ",
  "sn43.12:1.3": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṁ? ",
  "sn43.12:1.4": "Yo, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo—",
  "sn43.12:1.5": "idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṁ. ",
  "sn43.12:1.6": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo? ",
  "sn43.12:1.7": "Samatho. ",
  "sn43.12:1.8": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo. ",
  "sn43.12:1.9": "Iti kho, bhikkhave, desitaṁ vo mayā asaṅkhataṁ, desito asaṅkhatagāmimaggo. ",
  "sn43.12:1.10": "Yaṁ, bhikkhave, satthārā karaṇīyaṁ sāvakānaṁ hitesinā anukampakena anukampaṁ upādāya, kataṁ vo taṁ mayā. ",
  "sn43.12:1.11": "Etāni, bhikkhave, rukkhamūlāni, etāni suññāgārāni. Jhāyatha, bhikkhave, mā pamādattha; mā pacchā vippaṭisārino ahuvattha. Ayaṁ vo amhākaṁ anusāsanīti. ",
  "sn43.12:2.1": "Asaṅkhatañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi asaṅkhatagāmiñca maggaṁ. ",
  "sn43.12:2.2": "Taṁ suṇātha. ",
  "sn43.12:2.3": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṁ? ",
  "sn43.12:2.4": "Yo, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo—",
  "sn43.12:2.5": "idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, asaṅkhataṁ. ",
  "sn43.12:2.6": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, asaṅkhatagāmimaggo? ",
  "sn43.12:2.7": "Vipassanā. ",
  "sn43.12:2.8": "Ayaṁ vuccati, 